"Learnomy utilise sa propre caisse Stripe et PayPal."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1475
msgid "Use WooCommerce"
msgstr "Utiliser WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1484
msgid "Send Learnomy purchases to the WooCommerce cart and checkout"
msgstr "Envoyer les achats Learnomy au panier et à la caisse WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1492
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses and memberships check out through WooCommerce "
"(one dynamic line item per purchase). Requires WooCommerce to stay active. "
"Leave off to keep Learnomy's built-in Stripe/PayPal checkout."
msgstr ""
"Quand c'est activé, les cours et adhésions payants se paient via "
"WooCommerce (un article dynamique par achat). Demande que WooCommerce reste "
"actif. Désactive-le pour garder la caisse Stripe/PayPal intégrée de "
"Learnomy."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1494
msgid ""
"Activate the WooCommerce plugin to use this option. Learnomy keeps using "
"its own Stripe/PayPal checkout until then."
msgstr ""
"Active le plug-in WooCommerce pour utiliser cette option. Learnomy continue "
"à utiliser sa propre caisse Stripe/PayPal jusque-là."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1514
msgid "Test Gateway"
msgstr "Passerelle de test"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1515
msgid "DEVELOPMENT ONLY"
msgstr "DÉVELOPPEMENT UNIQUEMENT"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1518
msgid ""
"Synchronous in-memory gateway that completes every checkout without hitting "
"an external service. Useful for development, demos, and QA. Turn this off "
"before going live."
msgstr ""
"Passerelle synchrone en mémoire qui complète chaque paiement sans appeler "
"un service externe. Utile pour le développement, les démos et le QA. "
"Désactive-la avant de passer en production."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1524
msgid "Enable Test Gateway"
msgstr "Activer la passerelle de test"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1532
msgid "Show the Test Gateway option at checkout"
msgstr "Affiche l'option Passerelle de test à la caisse"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1538
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses show a \"Test Gateway\" option alongside Stripe "
"and PayPal. Clicking it instantly records a completed transaction and "
"enrolls the buyer."
msgstr ""
"Quand c'est activé, les cours payants affichent une option \"Passerelle de "
"test\" à côté de Stripe et PayPal. En cliquant dessus, une transaction "
"complétée est enregistrée et l'acheteur est inscrit."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1555
msgid ""
"Add one flat tax rate to every paid checkout, for basic compliance. Need "
"per-region rates, exemptions, or reporting? Use the WooCommerce gateway, "
"which brings its own tax engine."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un taux de taxe fixe à chaque paiement, pour la conformité de base. "
"Besoin de taux par région, d'exonérations ou de rapports ? Utilise la "
"passerelle WooCommerce, qui apporte son propre moteur de taxe."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1559
msgid "Applies to Stripe checkouts only."
msgstr "S'applique uniquement aux paiements Stripe."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1560
msgid ""
"PayPal and other gateways do not add this tax, so a sale paid through "
"PayPal collects no tax. If you sell via PayPal, use the WooCommerce gateway "
"(it brings its own tax engine) or configure tax inside PayPal."
msgstr ""
"PayPal et les autres passerelles n'ajoutent pas cette taxe, donc une vente "
"payée via PayPal ne collecte aucune taxe. Si tu vends via PayPal, utilise "
"la passerelle WooCommerce (elle a son propre moteur fiscal) ou configure la "
"taxe dans PayPal."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1565
msgid "Collect tax"
msgstr "Collecter la taxe"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1573
msgid "Add a flat tax rate to paid Stripe checkouts"
msgstr "Ajouter un taux de taxe fixe aux paiements Stripe payants"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1579
msgid ""
"When enabled, the tax shows on the order summary and on the secure card "
"form, and is charged on top of the price."
msgstr ""
"Quand c'est activé, la taxe s'affiche sur le résumé de la commande et sur "
"le formulaire de carte sécurisé, et est facturée en plus du prix."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1584
msgid "Tax rate (%)"
msgstr "Taux de taxe (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1589
msgid "A single percentage applied to every paid purchase, e.g. 20 for 20%."
msgstr ""
"Un pourcentage unique appliqué à chaque achat payant, par exemple 20 pour "
"20 %."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1593
msgid "Tax label"
msgstr "Étiquette de taxe"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1598
msgid "What to call the tax on the order summary, e.g. Tax, VAT, GST."
msgstr ""
"Comment appeler la taxe sur le résumé de la commande, par exemple Taxe, "
"TVA, GST."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1617
msgid "Membership page content"
msgstr "Contenu de la page d'adhésion"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1618
msgid "The headline, intro, and FAQ shown on the public membership pricing page."
msgstr ""
"Le titre, l'introduction et la FAQ affichés sur la page de tarification "
"publique d'adhésion."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1624
#: includes/services/view-data/class-membership-pricing-view-data.php:112
#: templates/membership-pricing.php:66
msgid "Simple, transparent pricing"
msgstr "Tarification simple et transparente"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1625
