#: includes/class-abilities.php:49
msgid "Course Management"
msgstr "Gestion des cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:50
msgid "Create, publish, update, and manage LMS courses."
msgstr "Créer, publier, mettre à jour et gérer les cours LMS."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:57
msgid "Learning & Progress"
msgstr "Apprentissage et progression"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:58
msgid "Enroll students, track lesson progress, and manage course completions."
msgstr ""
"Inscrire les étudiants, suivre la progression des leçons et gérer les "
"complétions de cours."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:65
msgid "Quizzes & Assessments"
msgstr "Quiz et évaluations"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:66
msgid "Create quizzes, manage attempts, and grade student responses."
msgstr "Créer des quiz, gérer les tentatives et évaluer les réponses des étudiants."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:73
msgid "Revenue & Memberships"
msgstr "Revenus et adhésions"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:74
msgid "Manage memberships, instructor earnings, withdrawals, and coupons."
msgstr ""
"Gérer les adhésions, les gains des instructeurs, les retraits et les "
"coupons."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:81
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "Administration"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:82
msgid "Approve instructors, moderate courses, and manage plugin settings."
msgstr ""
"Approuver les instructeurs, modérer les cours et gérer les paramètres du "
"plugin."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:89
#: includes/widgets/class-course-search-widget.php:17
msgid "Course Search"
msgstr "Recherche de cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:90
msgid "Search and browse the published course catalog."
msgstr "Rechercher et parcourir le catalogue des cours publiés."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:97
msgid "Content Authoring"
msgstr "Création de contenu"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:98
msgid ""
"Build course content: sections, lessons, topics, questions, and taxonomy. "
"Ownership-scoped."
msgstr ""
"Construire le contenu du cours : sections, leçons, sujets, questions et "
"taxonomie. Limité à la propriété."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:105
msgid "Reporting & Analytics"
msgstr "Rapports et analyses"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:106
msgid ""
"Read-only academy reporting: course/quiz analytics, student rosters, "
"at-risk learners. Instructor-scoped."
msgstr ""
"Rapports d'académie en lecture seule : analyses de cours/quiz, listes "
"d'étudiants, étudiants à risque. Limité à l'instructeur."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:143
msgid "Create a new draft course with title, description, and access settings."
msgstr ""
"Créer un nouveau cours brouillon avec titre, description et paramètres "
"d'accès."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:204
msgid "Get Course"
msgstr "Obtenir un cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:205
msgid ""
"Retrieve a single course by ID, including its status, price, and instructor "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Récupère un cours unique par ID, incluant son statut, son prix et les "
"détails de l'instructeur."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:251
msgid "Update course fields such as title, description, price, or access type."
msgstr ""
"Mets à jour les champs du cours tels que le titre, la description, le prix "
"ou le type d'accès."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:312
msgid "Delete Course"
msgstr "Supprimer le Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:313
msgid ""
"Permanently delete a course and all its sections, lessons, and progress "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Supprime définitivement un cours et toutes ses sections, leçons et données "
"de progression."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:356
msgid "Publish Course"
msgstr "Publier le Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:357
msgid "Publish a draft course to make it visible and enrollable by students."
msgstr ""
"Publie un cours brouillon pour le rendre visible et permettre aux étudiants "
"de s'y inscrire."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:405
msgid "Duplicate Course"
msgstr "Dupliquer le Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:406
msgid ""
"Clone an existing course into a new draft, copying all sections, lessons, "
"and instructor assignments."
msgstr ""
"Clone un cours existant en un nouveau brouillon, copiant toutes les "
"sections, leçons et attributions d'instructeur."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:449
msgid "List Courses"
msgstr "Lister les Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:450
msgid ""
"List published courses with pagination, returning title, price, rating, and "
"student count."
msgstr ""
"Liste les cours publiés avec pagination, retournant le titre, le prix, "
"l'évaluation et le nombre d'étudiants."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:498
msgid "Get Course Stats"
msgstr "Obtenir les Statistiques du Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:499
msgid ""
"Retrieve aggregate statistics for a course: student count, average rating, "
"and completion rate."
msgstr ""
"Récupère les statistiques agrégées pour un cours : nombre d'étudiants, "
"évaluation moyenne et taux d'achèvement."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:550
msgid "Enroll in Course"
msgstr "S'inscrire au Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:551
msgid ""
"Enroll a student in a course, checking prerequisites before creating the "
"enrollment record."
msgstr ""
"Inscrit un étudiant à un cours, en vérifiant les prérequis avant de créer "
"l'enregistrement d'inscription."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:612
msgid "Unenroll from Course"
msgstr "Se désinscrire du Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:613
msgid ""
"Cancel a student enrollment by enrollment ID, reducing the course student "
"count."
msgstr ""
"Annule l'inscription d'un étudiant par ID d'inscription, réduisant le "
"nombre d'étudiants du cours."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:644 includes/cli/class-inspect.php:210
msgid "Enrollment not found."
msgstr "Inscription non trouvée."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:667
msgid "Access Lesson"
msgstr "Accéder à la Leçon"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:668
msgid ""
"Check whether the current user can view a lesson right now, accounting for "
"the drip schedule."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie si l'utilisateur actuel peut voir une leçon maintenant, en tenant "
"compte du calendrier de déploiement."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:708
msgid "Complete Lesson"
msgstr "Terminer la Leçon"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:709
msgid ""
"Mark a lesson as completed for a student, updating course progress and "
"triggering completion checks."
msgstr ""
"Marque une leçon comme terminée pour un étudiant, mettant à jour la "
"progression du cours et déclenchant les vérifications d'achèvement."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:774
msgid "Get Course Progress"
msgstr "Obtenir la Progression du Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:775
msgid "Retrieve a student's progress percentage for a specific course."
msgstr ""
"Récupère le pourcentage de progression d'un étudiant pour un cours "
"spécifique."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:829
msgid "Restart Course"
msgstr "Redémarrer le Cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:830
msgid ""
"Reset all lesson progress and quiz attempts for a student in a course so "
"they can start fresh."
msgstr ""
"Réinitialise toute la progression des leçons et les tentatives de quiz pour "
"un étudiant dans un cours afin qu'il puisse recommencer."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:889
msgid "Get Enrollment"
msgstr "Obtenir l'Inscription"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:890
msgid "Retrieve enrollment details for a specific student and course combination."
msgstr ""
"Récupère les détails d'inscription pour une combinaison spécifique "
"d'étudiant et de cours."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:946
msgid "List Enrollments"
msgstr "Lister les Inscriptions"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:947
msgid ""
"List all course enrollments for a student, ordered by most recently "
"enrolled."
msgstr ""
"Liste toutes les inscriptions aux cours pour un étudiant, ordonnées par les "
"plus récemment inscrites."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1002
msgid ""
"Begin a new quiz attempt for the current student, enforcing attempt limits "
"and quiz availability windows."
msgstr ""
"Commence une nouvelle tentative de quiz pour l'étudiant actuel, en "
"appliquant les limites de tentatives et les fenêtres de disponibilité du "
"quiz."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1049 includes/class-template-loader.php:1045
msgid "Submit Quiz"
msgstr "Soumettre le Quiz"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1050
msgid ""
"Submit a quiz attempt for grading, auto-grading objective questions and "
"flagging essays for manual review."
msgstr ""
"Soumet une tentative de quiz pour évaluation, en évaluant automatiquement "
"les questions objectives et en signalant les essais pour examen manuel."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1085 includes/class-abilities.php:1197
#: includes/class-abilities.php:2274
msgid "Quiz attempt not found."
msgstr "Tentative de quiz non trouvée."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1104
msgid "Grade Question Response"
msgstr "Évaluer la Réponse à la Question"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1105
msgid ""
"Manually grade an essay or open-ended question response with a score and "
"instructor feedback."
msgstr ""
"Évalue manuellement une réponse d'essai ou de question ouverte avec une "
"note et des commentaires d'instructeur."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1159
msgid "Get Quiz Results"
msgstr "Obtenir les Résultats du Quiz"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1160
msgid ""
"Retrieve the full details of a quiz attempt including score, percentage, "
"pass/fail status, and grading state."
msgstr ""
"Récupère les détails complets d'une tentative de quiz, incluant la note, le "
"pourcentage, l'état réussi/échoué et l'état d'évaluation."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1220
msgid ""
"Create a new quiz, optionally attaching it to a course and configuring "
"attempt limits and a passing score."
msgstr ""
"Crée un nouveau quiz, en l'attachant optionnellement à un cours et en "
"configurant les limites de tentatives et une note de passage."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1293
msgid "Subscribe to Membership Plan"
msgstr "S'abonner au Plan d'Adhésion"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1294
msgid ""
"Subscribe a student to a membership plan, enrolling them in all courses the "
"plan includes."
msgstr ""
"Abonne un étudiant à un plan d'adhésion, l'inscrivant à tous les cours que "
"le plan inclut."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1357
msgid "Cancel Membership Subscription"
msgstr "Annuler l'abonnement à la formule d'adhésion"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1358
msgid ""
"Cancel an active membership subscription; access continues until the end of "
"the current billing period."
msgstr ""
"Annule un abonnement à une formule d'adhésion active ; l'accès continue "
"jusqu'à la fin de la période de facturation actuelle."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1401
msgid "Get Instructor Earnings"
msgstr "Obtenir les revenus du formateur"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1402
msgid ""
"Retrieve an instructor's commission summary showing total earned, pending "
"payout, and already paid amounts."
msgstr ""
"Récupère un résumé des commissions du formateur affichant le total gagné, "
"le paiement en attente et les montants déjà payés."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1451
msgid "Request Earnings Withdrawal"
msgstr "Demander un retrait des revenus"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1452
msgid ""
"Submit a withdrawal request for pending commission earnings, specifying the "
"amount and payout method."
msgstr ""
"Soumet une demande de retrait pour les revenus de commission en attente, en "
"spécifiant le montant et la méthode de paiement."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1520
msgid "Validate Coupon"
msgstr "Valider le coupon"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1521
msgid ""
"Check whether a coupon code is valid for a given course or membership plan, "
"returning the discount details."
msgstr ""
"Vérifie si un code de coupon est valide pour un cours ou une formule "
"d'adhésion donnée, en renvoyant les détails de la remise."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1584
msgid "List Membership Plans"
msgstr "Lister les formules d'adhésion"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1585
msgid ""
"List all active membership plans ordered by display order, with pricing and "
"included course counts."
msgstr ""
"Liste toutes les formules d'adhésion actives triées par ordre d'affichage, "
"avec les prix et les décomptes de cours inclus."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1623
msgid "Approve Instructor Application"
msgstr "Approuver la candidature du formateur"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1624
msgid ""
"Approve a pending instructor application and grant the user instructor "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Approuve une candidature de formateur en attente et accorde à l'utilisateur "
"les capacités de formateur."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1669
msgid "Reject Instructor Application"
msgstr "Rejeter la candidature du formateur"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1670
msgid ""
"Reject a pending instructor application with an optional reason that will "
"be visible to the applicant."
msgstr ""
"Rejette une candidature de formateur en attente avec une raison facultative "
"qui sera visible pour le candidat."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1717
msgid "Approve Course"
msgstr "Approuver le cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1718
msgid ""
"Approve a course submitted for review in marketplace mode, publishing it to "
"the catalog."
msgstr ""
"Approuve un cours soumis pour révision en mode marché, le publiant dans le "
"catalogue."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1760
msgid "Reject Course"
msgstr "Rejeter le cours"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1761
msgid ""
"Reject a pending course submission in marketplace mode, returning it to "
